#: common/config.py:1946
msgid "Failed to write new crontab."
msgstr "ຂຽນ crontab ໃໝ່ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ."

#: common/config.py:1955
msgid ""
"Cron is not running, even though the crontab command is available. Scheduled"
" backup jobs will not run. Cron might be installed but not enabled. Try "
"running the two commands \"systemctl enable cron\" and \"systemctl start "
"cron\", or consult the support channels of the currently used GNU/Linux "
"distribution for assistance."
msgstr ""
"Cron ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມີຄຳສັ່ງ crontab. "
"ວຽກສຳຮອງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ. Cron ອາດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້. "
"ລອງໃຊ້ສອງຄຳສັ່ງ \"systemctl enable cron\" ແລະ \"systemctl start cron\", ຫຼື "
"ປຶກສາຊ່ອງທາງການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ GNU/Linux distribution ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່."

